* A macro calling one defined after it that leaves a conditional open, the call ending in the
* part left out: r68 leaves out the rest of the source, ends too, and pads as without ends
* (zeros); the open macro known from the pre-scan, the padding chosen by as (r68__ended).
* fixed: ca33983 2026-10-12 r68togas: conditionals a macro body leaves open stay open after the call; padding when ends is left out
* expect text: 01020304 05000000
Outer macro
 Inner 4,5
 endm
Inner macro
 dc.b \1
 iflt \#-3
 dc.b \2
 else
 dc.b \2,\3
 endm
 psect macro_open_cond_ends,0,0,0,0,0
 dc.b 1,2,3
 Outer
 nop
 ends
